      "content": "new goals... that's just more climbing. another mountain to scale just to feel this same void again? it feels like a loop. i've spent my whole life running toward a finish line that doesn't even exist. i'm just tired. i feel like i've finished my part in this story and there isn't a sequel. it's like i've already said everything i needed to say.",
